MerkleAdapter.manage native value
├── given a valid proof and leaf role
│   ├── forwards every value bit unchanged
│   ├── accepts the full uint96 maximum
│   └── reuses the same proof and role across different native values
└── given a native-currency leaf budget
    ├── charges all calls to the same budget despite changing native values
    └── reverts calls that exceed the budget without retaining transfers or usage
